        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 78,
          "startingLine": 82
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Mifflin-St Jeor 方程",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 54,
          "startingLine": 47
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Mifflin-St Jeor 方程是目前普遍认为最准确的基础代谢率（BMR）计算公式之一。",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 54,
          "startingLine": 51
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "计算公式：",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 54,
          "startingLine": 54
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "该公式根据性别、年龄、体重和身高来估算身体在休息状态下每天消耗的卡路里。适用于大多数成年人，不考虑体脂率。",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 54,
          "startingLine": 74
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "男性: (10 × 体重kg) + (6.25 × 身高cm) - (5 × 年龄) + 5",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 58,
          "startingLine": 59
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "女性: (10 × 体重kg) + (6.25 × 身高cm) - (5 × 年龄) - 161",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 58,
          "startingLine": 66
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Katch-McArdle 方程",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 58,
          "startingLine": 131
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "关闭",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 78,
          "startingLine": 133
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Katch-McArdle 方程",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 54,
          "startingLine": 98
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Katch-McArdle 方程是一种针对已知体脂率人群的基础代谢率（BMR）计算公式。",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 54,
          "startingLine": 102
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "计算公式：",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 54,
          "startingLine": 105
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "这个公式被认为比Mifflin-St Jeor方程更准确，因为它考虑了瘦体重（Lean Body Mass），而瘦体重是影响基础代谢率的关键因素。适用于健身人群或对体脂率有准确了解的人。",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 54,
          "startingLine": 125
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "BMR = 370 + (21.6 × 去脂体重kg)",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 58,
          "startingLine": 110
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "去脂体重 = 体重kg × (1 - 体脂率% ÷ 100)",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 58,
          "startingLine": 117
        }
      },
