        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "目标热量说明",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 54,
          "startingLine": 288
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "目标热量是根据您的基础代谢率（BMR）、活动水平和健身目标计算得出的每日所需卡路里摄入量。",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 54,
          "startingLine": 292
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "TDEE计算公式：",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 54,
          "startingLine": 295
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "TDEE = BMR（基础代谢率）× 活动系数",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 54,
          "startingLine": 299
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "TDEE（Total Daily Energy Expenditure）是您每日总能量消耗，包括基础代谢、日常活动、运动等所有消耗的热量。",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 54,
          "startingLine": 306
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "热量范围依据：",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 54,
          "startingLine": 310
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "建议值是该范围的中间值，用于后续蛋白质、碳水化合物和脂肪的比例计算。实际摄入可根据身体反应和目标进展在范围内调整。",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 54,
          "startingLine": 339
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "• 减脂：TDEE - 300~500 卡路里",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 58,
          "startingLine": 315
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "  创造适度热量缺口，帮助减少脂肪，同时避免过快减重导致肌肉流失。",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 58,
          "startingLine": 317
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "• 维持：TDEE ± 100 卡路里",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 58,
          "startingLine": 322
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "  保持现有体重和体组成，允许小幅波动。",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 58,
          "startingLine": 325
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "• 增肌：TDEE + 300~500 卡路里",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 58,
          "startingLine": 330
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "  提供足够的热量盈余，支持肌肉生长，同时避免过量导致过多脂肪堆积。",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 58,
          "startingLine": 333
        }
      },
